<title>Sudan's civil war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sudan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sudan-2026-11-15T11:18:21.495Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 11:18:21 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Sudanese army has seized three locations in West Kordofan and is advancing toward Al-Nahud, expanding its territorial gains. The Rapid Support Forces continue to employ drones, striking civilian areas in West Kordofan and the Blue Nile, and a Sudanese drone was shot down after crossing from Ethiopia. RSF forces killed ten civilians in An-Nuhud. Humanitarian aid is deteriorating, with food assistance cut for 900,000 people. The conflict caused 4,680 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxORHVrVmJvSHRrc0FGaVNUaFBJd2txbFV1bVdqTm9kTERkT1lXb2lxRl80YzNpUndaeDUzb1Y2V1NnU21fV2w3TmR6RkNUbVhuVnBEaFAwQnc5Ymd4VWtDczZ1emE0Y2RyRnVPblFjWXVkLWVzcTN4VFY3S3FKcWNqdDlOLWlIanRYb0c3blVvZEN5eXJWa191V2RZWUEtVTdDLWhCZ1NVQlB1ak9zM3BBTllpQ0s0QW1WbXFxMWZ3QQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxOWXVTdmpMaE8xQjVDejhla3FQS3JuR1NjaW1TeGswMGlvVkpwNFRMVTliLWV6TG9zWk1DN1Z0b2NSQUpwYkNfMEJ4dW9jdWJWX0JvbVp6VFI0eHZWYjNDZEJvaXZ0UURXN3lUV216aWJBeHJIelh0WEhEam9QM2cwdXB0c3BzRVhNdVR3dkxMWTMtalR3amVUNE5UMk9mbTA?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxNbUdVY3hmeGp2dEhpeGtNZmRvZnAySGJDQ2xIemJTZnJhTmF4cnBNTVQ3RldURkhodURCMDkydVpreWpqUEpnOXQyZXRkLXJhb3paeDRXRTA4cUU0T3ktTXNwWTE4dXRPblpNN0IzRTJTLVFXT0NDWXQ4eVh0OUJaWkh2QWtyWkNwYlA0?oc=5&quot;&gt;Latest news from Azerbaijan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiyAFBVV95cUxNYW1oajU0M2RwZDF6YlBydUFnX0I3RHFNQ09ZVEYzbS1wTEs5R1ZsbzQySDhqcEYtd01nUDZobGs5Vm